# Adapted from Polestar's guide forever/alliance/06-ashenvale (GPL-3.0, github.com/fitzforge/polestar, revision 08536e3, with the fixes of the same guide up to tag v0.3.4).
# Changes: guide id, title, next guide, group notes, notes on the Horde in contested zones (0.9.9). Quest steps kept as Polestar wrote them,
# except where a comment marked "Groupe Alliance" says otherwise.
guide groupe-alliance/09-orneval-paluns
title Group 8 · Ashenvale, Wetlands & Stonetalon
folder Group Alliance
faction Alliance
levels 24-27
zone Ashenvale
next groupe-alliance/11-mille-pointes

# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Crimson Crate Delivery (98240), Retrieval for Mauren (1078).
# Left out: Daily Delivery (469).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkshore

step Moonglade
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Moonglade
  note Everyone at their own pace: what you already did ticks itself, the guide picks up where you are. Playing together? Group XP is best within 4 levels.
  goto 56.3,32.5 "Cast Teleport: Moonglade"

step Aquatic Form
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Moonglade
  tip Take the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine. Join the two half pendants into the Pendant of the Sea Lion and cast Teleport: Moonglade: Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. Then Silva Fil'naveth in Nighthaven flies Druids straight to Rut'theran Village. Dendrite stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  collect 15885 quest 272.1 only NightElf,Skyborne -- Pendant of the Sea Lion: join the two halves
  turnin 272 only NightElf,Skyborne -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 5061 only NightElf
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

step Darnassus
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Darnassus
  goto 35.4,8.4 "Darnassus"

step Mathrengyl Bearwalker
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Darnassus
  tip Take the portal up to the Cenarion Enclave, then fly back to Auberdine.
  turnin 5061 only NightElf -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Aquatic Form
  fly "Auberdine"

step Boat to Auberdine
  only NightElf,Priest
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 21.8,56.9 "Boat to Auberdine" live

step Fly to Rut'theran Village
  only NightElf,Priest
  zone Darkshore
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Auberdine flight master"
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

step Into Darnassus
  only NightElf,Priest
  zone Darnassus
  goto 85.7,35.9 "Into Darnassus"

step Darnassus
  only NightElf,Priest
  zone Darnassus
  goto 39.5,81.2 "Darnassus"

step Elune's Grace
  only NightElf,Priest
  zone Darnassus
  turnin 5673 only NightElf -- Priestess Alathea: Elune's Grace
  fly "Auberdine"

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: Blackfathom Deeps, optional, asked once (`when group 1275`) at the
# first pickup on the way: Argos Nightwhisper in Stormwind (The Corruption Abroad, 3765, an
# errand to Gershala; everyone but the Night Elf Druids, who reach Auberdine by Moonglade), else
# Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine. Every later dungeon step needs `when done bfd-start`.
# Quest ids, givers, levels, prerequisites, drops and rewards from Polestar's Forever data
# (data-v2026.11.1) and Dungeons codex, cross-checked with the TrinityCore Forever world base
# (2026-10-14: same prerequisites, 1200 after 1198, no prerequisite for 971, 1199, 1275, 3765).
# Wowhead Forever could not be read on 12/11/2026 (robot check). Places inside and the In Search
# of Thaelrid question from two WoW Forever quest guides read on 12/11/2026 and rewritten: Warcraft
# Tavern (quests 11/11/2026, dungeon guide) and Icy Veins (05/10/2026). Darnassus is a detour
# (1198, 1199 and their hand-ins): its own question (`when group 1198`). Not played in game.
step Stormwind: Argos Nightwhisper (Blackfathom Deeps, optional)
  only !Druid
  when group 1275
  when level<30
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Blackfathom Deeps: a 5-player dungeon on the north-west coast of Ashenvale, levels 22 to 28 (24 to 32 in the group finder). This guide takes its quests on the way, runs it from the Zoram Strand, then hands them in at Auberdine. Alone? Skip it: the guide goes on in Ashenvale.
  note Argos Nightwhisper only sends you to Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine, who gives the dungeon quest: a few hundred XP for a trip you make anyway.
  accept 3765                                 -- Argos Nightwhisper

step Boat to Auberdine
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 21.8,56.9 "Boat to Auberdine" live only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,Skyborne
  goto 21.8,56.9 "Boat to Auberdine" live only NightElf,Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step Boat to Auberdine
  when onquest 97926
  zone Darkshore
  tip From Stormwind Harbor take the boat to Auberdine; Thundris Windweaver stands at the north end of the village. Then head south along the road through Darkshore.
  turnin 97926 optional                       -- Thundris Windweaver: Alexston's reply, if you took it in Stormwind

step Auberdine: Gershala Nightwhisper (Blackfathom Deeps, optional)
  label bfd-start
  when group 1275
  when level<30
  zone Darkshore
  tip Blackfathom Deeps: a 5-player dungeon on the north-west coast of Ashenvale, levels 22 to 28 (24 to 32 in the group finder). Its quests are taken here and on the way, the dungeon is run from the Zoram Strand, and they are handed in back at Auberdine. Alone? Skip it: the guide goes on in Ashenvale.
  note Keep 5 free quest log slots. Every player takes the quests from the givers; sharing works too (click the quest in the log, then Share).
  turnin 3765 optional                        -- Argos Nightwhisper's errand, if you took it in Stormwind
  accept 1275                                 -- Gershala Nightwhisper

step Darnassus: the Argent Dawn (Blackfathom Deeps, optional detour)
  when group 1275
  when done bfd-start
  when group 1198
  zone Darnassus
  tip Two more Blackfathom quests wait in Darnassus, with the Argent Dawn: In Search of Thaelrid, then Blackfathom Villainy from Thaelrid inside the dungeon, and Twilight Falls. About 19,600 XP with the hand-ins, and a blue reward. The detour: the boat from the Auberdine dock to Rut'theran Village (Night Elves fly), the portal up to Darnassus, then back; the hand-ins need the same trip after Ashenvale. Short on time? Skip it.
  zone Teldrassil
  getfp "Rut'theran Village" only Human,Dwarf,Gnome,Skyborne
  fly "Rut'theran Village" only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  accept 1198 map 1457 @55.36,25.03         -- Dawnwatcher Shaedlass
  accept 1199 map 1457 @55.24,23.99         -- Argent Guard Manados

step Back to Auberdine
  when onquest 1198
  zone Darkshore
  tip Back down the portal to Rut'theran Village, then the flight to Auberdine.
  fly "Auberdine"

# Groupe Alliance (0.9.9): on Forever the escort ends at Kerlonian's bag, at the southern edge of
# Darkshore, and fails if he crosses into Ashenvale (Wowhead Forever quest text "on the road south
# to his bag" and several Forever comments); the hand-in at Maestra's Post stays, within the
# 25-minute timer.
step Kerlonian Evershade
  tip Kerlonian sleeps at the Grove of the Ancients in southern Darkshore. Use the Horn of Awakening to wake him and lead him south along the road to his bag, by the three-way fork at the southern edge of Darkshore; blow the horn again whenever he falls asleep. Do not cross into Ashenvale with him: on Forever the escort fails there.
  tip Careful: Two scripted ambushes of three mobs each attack along the road.
  tip Timed quest: 25 minutes, hand-in to Liladris at Maestra's Post included. Wake him only when ready to go straight on.
  goto 44.4,76.4 "Grove of the Ancients"
  accept 5321                                 -- Kerlonian Evershade
  collect 13536 quest 5321.1                  -- Kerlonian's Chest, beside him
  goto 44.4,76.4 "Kerlonian Evershade"
  note Escort Kerlonian to his bag at the southern edge of Darkshore, then hand the quest in at Maestra's Post.

step Ashenvale
  zone Ashenvale
  note Contested zone: Horde players quest here too, from Zoram'gar Outpost (west coast) and Splintertree Post (east). Their quests use the same spots as this guide: the Zoram Strand nagas, the Thistlefur camp north of Astranaar, the Foulweald, Mystral Lake. Stay grouped there.
  note A spot taken by the Horde? Skip the step (Skip button) and come back later. On the Normal ruleset, only players flagged for PvP can be attacked (PvP icon on the portrait). The Wetlands, later in this guide, have no Horde quests.
  goto 26.2,38.7 "Ashenvale"

