# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Astranaar

step Ilkrud Magthrull
  tip Ilkrud and his voidwalkers hold the Ruins of Ordil'Aran south of the shrine. Pull his guards first.
  collect 5533 quest 973                  -- Ilkrud Magthrull's Tome

step Melyria and Illiyana
  tip The two stand together at the western end of the road.
  accept 1021                         -- Illiyana
  accept 1022                         -- Sentinel Melyria Frostshadow
  tip South of the murlocs, Therysil waits at the Shrine of Aessina.
  turnin 945                              -- Therysil

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West

step Teronis' Corpse
  tip Head west to the shore of Lake Falathim. Teronis lies among the Saltspittle murlocs; any murloc can drop the Glowing Gem.
  turnin 991                              -- Teronis' Corpse
  accept 1023
  collect 5463 quest 1023                 -- Glowing Gem

step The Zoram Strand
  tip Follow the coast north to the Zoram Strand. Talen camps on the beach; Wrathtail nagas fill the shore.
  accept 1007                             -- Talen
  collect 5424 quest 1007 @14.2,20.6      -- Ancient Statuette, in the ruins on the shore

step Talen
  turnin 1007
  accept 1009

step Ruuzel
  tip Ruuzel walks the northern tip of the Zoram Strand with Wrathtail guards.
  collect 5445 quest 1009                 -- Ring of Zoram

step Talen
  turnin 1009

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: the Blackfathom Deeps run, from the Zoram Strand (entrance from the
# Dungeons codex: Ashenvale 14.5,14.2). Boss order from the codex (Ghamoo-ra, Lady Sarevess,
# Gelihast, Lorgus Jett, Old Serra'kis, Twilight Lord Kelris, Aku'mai); drops from Polestar's
# Forever data: Corrupted Brain Stem (Fallenroot satyrs and Blackfathom naga, 80 %), Twilight
# Pendant (Twilight cultists, 80 %), Head of Kelris (100 %), Lorgalis Manuscript (the Pitted Iron
# Chest, 13949, the one container Polestar keeps). Places: Warcraft Tavern and Icy Veins (Forever).
step Blackfathom Deeps: before going in
  when group 1275
  when done bfd-start
  zone Ashenvale
  tip The portal is in the half-sunken temple at the north end of the Zoram Strand: swim down to it. Group of 5, levels 22 to 28; every enemy inside is elite.
  note In the quest log before going in: Researching the Corruption (Gershala Nightwhisper, Auberdine). If you took them: In Search of Thaelrid and Twilight Falls (Darnassus, a detour), Knowledge in the Deeps (Gerrig Bonegrip, Ironforge, offered in Group 3: too far to fetch now). Nothing to bring.
  note Warlocks: The Orb of Soran'ruk (Doan Karhan, in the Barrens) takes three fragments from the Twilight Acolytes here and one from Shadowfang Keep; it is not on this route.
  goto 14.5,14.2 "Blackfathom Deeps" r 25

step Blackfathom Deeps: along the way
  when group 1275
  when done bfd-start
  along until bfd-kelris
  tip Collected all through the dungeon: the brain stems from the nagas and the Fallenroot satyrs (those outside the portal drop them too), the Twilight Pendants from the Twilight's Hammer cultists, about 4 kills in 5 for each. Every player with the quest loots their own; with a full group on them, a second run may be needed.
  note Share the quests with your group: click each in the quest log, then Share.
  collect 5952 x8 quest 1275                  -- Corrupted Brain Stem: Blackfathom nagas, Fallenroot satyrs
  collect 5879 x10 quest 1199 optional        -- Twilight Pendant: Twilight's Hammer cultists

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0 (review): the two class quests of the codex for this dungeon, shown only
# to the class and only to whoever holds the quest. Drops from Polestar's Forever data: Corrupted
# Kor Gem (Blackfathom Tide Priestess, Oracle and Sea Witch, 50 %), Soran'ruk Fragment (Twilight
# Acolyte, 100 %); Icy Veins' Forever quest guide (05/10/2026) says the same.
step Paladins: Seeking the Kor Gem
  only Paladin
  when done bfd-start
  when onquest 1442
  along until bfd-kelris
  tip The Blackfathom Tide Priestesses, Oracles and Sea Witches (the naga casters) drop the Corrupted Kor Gem, about 1 in 2. Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine cleanses it, on the way back.
  collect 6995 quest 1442                     -- Corrupted Kor Gem: naga casters

step Warlocks: The Orb of Soran'ruk
  only Warlock
  when done bfd-start
  when onquest 1740
  along until bfd-kelris
  tip The Twilight Acolytes of the Twilight's Hammer area drop the Soran'ruk Fragments. The large fragment comes from Shadowfang Keep, not on this route: Polestar's class guides (Orb of Soran'ruk) cover it.
  collect 6914 x3 quest 1740                  -- Soran'ruk Fragment: Twilight Acolytes

step Blackfathom Deeps: Ghamoo-ra's pool
  when group 1275
  when done bfd-start
  tip The great turtle Ghamoo-ra lives in the first big pool. The Lorgalis Manuscript lies in a chest underwater, in an alcove north of that pool: swim down for it, every player with the quest opens the chest. Argent Guard Thaelrid waits in another underwater cave, its entrance south-east of the same pool (next step).
  collect 5359 quest 971 optional             -- Lorgalis Manuscript, in the Pitted Iron Chest
  kill 4887                                   -- Ghamoo-ra

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0 (review): Thaelrid comes right after Ghamoo-ra, before Lady Sarevess:
# both WoW Forever quest guides put him by Ghamoo-ra's pool (Warcraft Tavern, 11/11/2026: "an
# alcove of the room where you face Ghamoo-ra"; Icy Veins, 05/10/2026: "a cave hidden underwater,
# its entrance on the southeast of the area where Ghamoo-ra is").
step Blackfathom Deeps: Argent Guard Thaelrid
  when group 1275
  when done bfd-start
  when onquest 1198
  tip Thaelrid of the Argent Dawn waits in an underwater cave whose entrance is south-east of Ghamoo-ra's pool. Talk to him BEFORE killing Kelris: Kelris's head drops only for players who already hold Blackfathom Villainy.
  turnin 1198                                 -- Argent Guard Thaelrid
  accept 1200

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: Blackfathom Villainy does not need In Search of Thaelrid (Polestar's
# Forever data and Icy Veins' Forever guide: "not required to start it"; the TrinityCore base says
# otherwise, without Forever proof). Without it, the player asks Thaelrid; the accept stays optional.
step Blackfathom Deeps: Argent Guard Thaelrid (without the Darnassus quest)
  when group 1275
  when done bfd-start
  when !onquest 1198
  when !turnedin 1198
  tip Thaelrid of the Argent Dawn waits in an underwater cave whose entrance is south-east of Ghamoo-ra's pool. He offers Blackfathom Villainy without In Search of Thaelrid too. Talk to him BEFORE killing Kelris; not offered? Carry on.
  talk 4787                                   -- Argent Guard Thaelrid
  accept 1200 optional

step Blackfathom Deeps: Lady Sarevess and Gelihast
  when group 1275
  when done bfd-start
  tip Lady Sarevess, the second boss, comes with two guards: interrupt her Forked Lightning, it chains between players standing close (spread out). Gelihast, the murloc of the side cave, is optional: pull his murlocs one at a time; the stone behind him gives the Blessing of Blackfathom. The Twilight's Hammer cultists come after them.
  kill 4831                                   -- Lady Sarevess
  kill 6243 optional                          -- Gelihast

step Blackfathom Deeps: Twilight Lord Kelris
  label bfd-kelris
  when group 1275
  when done bfd-start
  tip Kelris waits in the ceremonial chamber before the last room. Interrupt his Sleep and kill his adds first. Every player on Blackfathom Villainy loots their own head. Aku'mai, behind him, is optional: no quest, good loot.
  collect 5881 quest 1200 optional            -- Head of Kelris
  kill 4832                                   -- Twilight Lord Kelris
  kill 4829 optional                          -- Aku'mai

step Blackfathom Deeps: leave
  when group 1275
  when done bfd-start
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Leave by the portal and go on along the coast: Gershala's and the Darnassus hand-ins wait for the end of Ashenvale, at Auberdine.
  enter "Ashenvale"

