step The Foulweald
  tip The Foulweald furbolgs live in the woods south of the road, south-east of Astranaar. The Den Watcher and the Ursas guard the den.
  kill 3746 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Den Watcher
  kill 3749 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Ursa
  kill 3750 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Totemic
  kill 3743 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Warrior

# Groupe Alliance (0.9.9): the bracers are no quest objective, so the second tip, the kill,
# use and bracer notes explain the count; the use line puts the Divining Scroll on the quest
# item button.
step Mystral Lake
  tip Sentinel Velene Starstrike stands at the Silverwind Refuge on the east shore of Mystral Lake; Alonso camps on its west shore. Befouled Water Elementals wade in the lake between them.
  tip The game counts only the Divined Scroll, not the bracers: the elementals' tooltip shows no count, so follow the bracer line of this step. Only Intact Elemental Bracers count, other bracers are junk. With 5 in the bags, right-click the Divining Scroll: it turns them into the Divined Scroll, then hand it in.
  accept 1016                             -- Sentinel Velene Starstrike
  kill 3917 optional                      -- Befouled Water Elemental
  collect 12220 x5 optional               -- Not every elemental drops one (about 1 in 5 in the data): this line counts them
  use 5456 quest 1016.1 @46.6,69.6        -- With 5 bracers in the bags: right-click it in the bags
  collect 5455 quest 1016 @46.6,69.6      -- Made by the Divining Scroll from the 5 bracers
  turnin 1016

step Alonso
  goto 42.4,70 "Alonso"
  accept 78132 optional                   -- Alonso may not offer these to every class; if he doesn't, carry on.; walks around The Talondeep Path: the map marks where to look
  turnin 78132
  accept 78133 optional
  turnin 78133
  accept 78134 optional
  turnin 78134

