# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Menethil Harbor

step Spoils of War
  tip The timber planks and iron pallets lie in the water all around Menethil Harbor, west, north and east of the town, on the bottom or floating: swim for them. Giant crocolisks guard some of the iron. Lowering ground clutter makes them easier to see.
  collect 279821 quest 98197              -- Khaz Modan Timber
  collect 279822 quest 98197              -- Khaz Modan Iron

# Groupe Alliance (0.9.9): Crimson Crate Delivery (98240) comes after Crocs of the Sky (98072),
# which the pack takes only in Group 9 and hands in in Group 12 (Wowhead Forever series and
# MetaForge chain): optional here, so the step no longer waits for a quest James Halloran
# does not offer yet.
step James Halloran
  accept 98240 optional                   -- Only after Crocs of the Sky, a later quest of his: not offered? Carry on
  tip James Halloran stands by the north gate.
  turnin 98197                        -- Inside
# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Menethil Harbor

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Bluegill Marsh

step Bluegill Marsh
  tip Follow the coast north out of Menethil. Bluegill Murlocs fill the marsh; Gobbler walks with a pack in the middle of it.
  kill 1024 quest 279                     -- Bluegill Murloc
  collect 3618 quest 279                  -- Gobbler's Head

step Karl Boran
  turnin 279
  accept 281

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East Wetlands

step Young crocolisks
  tip Follow the road east. Young Wetlands Crocolisks lurk in the pools north of the excavation site.
  collect 3397 quest 484                  -- Young Crocolisk Skin

step The Bluegill hovels
  tip Three containers in the murloc hovels, south to north: the Damaged Crate, then the Sealed Barrel, then the Half-buried Barrel at the north end.
  turnin 281 @13.5,41.4                   -- Damaged Crate
  accept 284
  turnin 284 @13.6,38.2                   -- Sealed Barrel
  accept 285
  turnin 285 @13.9,34.8                   -- Half-buried Barrel
  accept 286

step Whelgar's Excavation Site
  tip The excavation site sits on the hill south of the road.
  turnin 305                              -- Merrin Rockweaver, below ground
  accept 299                              -- Prospector Whelgar
  accept 306
  accept 294                              -- Ormer Ironbraid

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East Wetlands

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Whelgar's Excavation Site

step The raptor hills
  tip Mottled Raptors and Screechers roam the hills west of the excavation site.
  tip Careful: Once a Mottled Screecher drops to 30% health, it calls for help from creatures within 20 yd. Mottled Screechers frequently come in packs of three, and raptors summoned by their calls for help may also join the fight.
  kill 1021 quest 294                     -- Mottled Screecher
  kill 1020 quest 294                     -- Mottled Raptor

step Ormer Ironbraid
  turnin 294
  accept 295

step Raptor valley
  tip The bigger raptors hunt in the valley just west of the dig.
  kill 1022 quest 295                     -- Mottled Scytheclaw
  kill 1023 quest 295                     -- Mottled Razormaw

step Ormer Ironbraid
  turnin 295
  accept 296                              -- Ormer Ironbraid

step The Green Belt
  tip Einar Stonegrip camps by the road; Rethiel the Greenwarden stands farther east, by the river.
  turnin 463                              -- Rethiel the Greenwarden
  accept 276

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Green Belt

step Thelgen Rock
  tip Cave Stalkers and Leech Stalkers fill Thelgen Rock, the cave south-east of the excavation site.
  collect 280319 quest 98282              -- Unruptured Stalker Gland

step The Mosshide gnolls
  tip Mosshide Gnolls and Mongrels hold the hills south-east of the Green Belt.
  kill 1007 quest 276                     -- Mosshide Gnoll
  kill 1008 quest 276                     -- Mosshide Mongrel

step Rethiel the Greenwarden
  turnin 276
  accept 277

step Wetlands: kill these as you meet them
  zone Wetlands
  tip Black, Crimson and Monstrous Oozes fill Ironbeard's Tomb, just west of the road to Dun Modr and north of Einar's camp. Any ooze there may hold Sida's bag.
  tip Mosshide Fenrunners and Mistweavers roam the riverbanks just west and south of Rethiel; almost every one drops flint.
  collect 3349 quest 470 @44.6,25.6       -- Sida's Bag
  collect 2611 quest 277

step Rethiel the Greenwarden
  turnin 277
  accept 275

step The Green Belt: kill these as you meet them
  zone Wetlands
  tip Fen Creepers hide in the marsh pools north-west of the Green Belt.
  tip Careful: When out of combat, Fen Creepers cast Sneak from time to time, so they are stealthed and hard to see.
  kill 1040 quest 275 @24.46,33.18 map 1437 era

# Groupe Alliance (0.9.9): the Goaz Stone chain (299, 98216, 98310, 98313) and Carnage (98283,
# after Blisters on the Land 275) were taken before what comes ahead of them (Wowhead Forever
# series, MetaForge chains): Carnage is offered here, after 275, and the Goaz quests follow
# 299 in Group 9 and Group 12.
step Rethiel the Greenwarden
  turnin 275
  accept 98283 optional                   -- Rethiel the Greenwarden: Carnage, an elite raptor, done in Group 12

# Groupe Alliance (0.9.9): Return the Statuette (98189) moved here from the first visit to
# Menethil. The quest data give it no prerequisite, but Wowhead Forever lists it 6th of an
# 8-quest series after the murloc hovels chain (279, 281, 284, 285, 286), with Karl Boran's
# text on receiving the statuette, and Karl Boran did not offer it before 286 in game.
# 98190 (Stoutfist) and 98191 (Bolvar) follow by their texts; 98219 needs 98191.
step Karl Boran
  turnin 286
  accept 98189 npc 1242                   -- Karl Boran: for Captain Stoutfist in the keep. He offers it only after this hand-in

step Captain Stoutfist
  tip Captain Stoutfist stands in Menethil Keep, a short walk from Karl Boran.
  turnin 98189 npc 2104                   -- Captain Stoutfist, on the top floor
  accept 98190 npc 2104                   -- For Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep: keep it

step Menethil
  tip Pilot Longbeard's quest in Ironforge needs level 28. If you are short of it after these hand-ins, grind the Dragonmaw orcs at the camps along the road east to Dun Algaz before you go on.
  turnin 484
  accept 471                              -- For the giant crocolisks of the north coast, on your next visit
  turnin 306                              -- Tarrel Rockweaver
  turnin 470                              -- Sida
  turnin 98282                            -- Caitlin Grassman, inside
  level 28
  vendor nearest

step Into Loch Modan
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 25.6,10.5 "Into Loch Modan"

step Into Dun Morogh
  zone Dun Morogh
  goto 84.4,31.1 "Into Dun Morogh"

step Into Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  goto 21.6,77.8 "Into Ironforge"

step Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  goto 72.1,51.9 "Ironforge"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  tip Head east along the Wetlands road, south through Dun Algaz into Loch Modan and west through the tunnel into Dun Morogh to Ironforge.
  getfp "Ironforge" npc 1573              -- Gryth Thurden, in the Great Forge
  turnin 1072                             -- Lomac Gearstrip, Tinker Town
  turnin 968 optional                     -- Only with Book: The Powers Below from Darkshore: Gerrig Bonegrip, the Forlorn Cavern
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  vendor nearest
  accept 1179                             -- Pilot Longbeard

step Ironforge: Gerrig Bonegrip
  when complete 971
  zone Ironforge
  tip Knowledge in the Deeps, from Blackfathom Deeps: Gerrig Bonegrip is in the Forlorn Cavern.
  turnin 971                              -- Gerrig Bonegrip

step Buliwyf Stonehand
  only Warrior
  zone Ironforge
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Axes" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Axes from Buliwyf Stonehand (Military Ward, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
  train 11865                         -- Buliwyf Stonehand

step Buliwyf Stonehand
  only Warrior
  zone Ironforge
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Maces" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Maces from Buliwyf Stonehand (Military Ward, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
  train 11865                         -- Buliwyf Stonehand

step Buliwyf Stonehand
  only Paladin
  zone Ironforge
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Axes" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Axes from Buliwyf Stonehand (Military Ward, 10 silver); two-handers level a Paladin fastest.
  train 11865                         -- Buliwyf Stonehand

step Ironforge priests
  only Dwarf,Gnome,Priest
  tip High Priest Rohan and High Priestess Mims are in the Hall of Mysteries, in the Mystic Ward.
  turnin 5645 only Dwarf                      -- High Priest Rohan: Chastise
  turnin 94819 only Gnome                     -- High Priestess Mims: Contingency Plan

step Tram to Stormwind
  zone Ironforge
  goto 78.0,51.4 "Tram to Stormwind"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stormwind

step Cathedral of Light
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Take the Deeprun Tram from Tinker Town to Stormwind's Dwarven District, then walk to the Cathedral Square.
  accept 343                              -- Brother Kristoff, in the Cathedral Square

step Stormwind Keep
  turnin 343                              -- Milton Sheaf, in the Royal Library
  turnin 337 optional                     -- Only if you looted An Old History Book in Duskwood
  turnin 98190 npc 1748                   -- Highlord Bolvar Fordragon
  accept 98191 npc 1748

step Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  turnin 98191 npc 928                    -- Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  accept 98219 npc 928                    -- For Lieutenant Farren Orinelle in Southshore: keep it

step Collin Mauren
  accept 1078
  tip The Slaughtered Lamb is in the Mage Quarter.
  turnin 1075                             -- Collin Mauren

